":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award®-winning director Danny Boyle and Academy Award®-nominated writer Alex Garland reunite for 28 Years Later, a terrifying new story set in the world created by 28 Days Later. It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine, some have found ways to exist amidst the infected. One such group of survivors lives on a small island connected to the mainland by a single, heavily-defended causeway. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=poEFz8Ivzug\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001100\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003678\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a7823fd3-66f7-47af-87ba-d36ef45b168c\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00