t, Tom Peitzman and Ryan Halprin serving as executive producers.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"“Lilo & Stitch” is the wildly funny and touching story of a lonely Hawaiian girl and the fugitive alien who helps to mend her broken family.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":108,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8SBLkgpQ99U\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001269\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001723\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004973\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005592\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006407\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006408\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010016\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011110\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011111\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011112\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011113\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\",\"0000000007\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"560b5a6d-5c9a-496d-a7c0-df3e44b57480\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006095\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007515\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006096\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Mission: Impossible - The Final Reckoning\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Light the fuse because Tom Cruise's world-saving super spy Ethan Hunt is back to complete a mission for the ages alongside Simon Pegg, Ving Rhames and Hayley Atwell. This propulsive action-adventure demands to be seen on the big screen.    \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Our lives are the sum of our choices. Tom Cruise is Ethan Hunt in Mission: Impossibl