ticism of Wagner’s dynamic score.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Raised by a scheming dwarf and unaware of his true family origins, a young man embarks on an epic journey. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-31\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":330,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003814\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006115\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006116\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000286\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000490\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000606\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000607\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000608\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000609\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"0000526f-f09f-444c-9d66-e6ec960d9d6d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006232\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007689\",\"eventId\":\"0000000042\",\"distributorName\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000003814\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Christopher \",\"familyName\":\"Maltman\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000006115\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Christopher\",\"familyName\":\"Purves\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000006116\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Barrie\",\"familyName\":\"Kosky\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000286\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Soloman\",\"familyName\":\"Howard\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000490\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Elisabet\",\"familyName\":\"Strid\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000606\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Andreas\",\"familyName\":\"Schager\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000607\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Peter\",\"familyName\":\"Hoare\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"i